  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.16,
      "end_seconds": 4.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Sorry, doctor, shall I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.34,
      "end_seconds": 10.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Yes, have a a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.31,
      "end_seconds": 22.74,
      "duration_seconds": 10.43,
      "text": "yeah, it's a lump near my back passage. I don't know what's causing it. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.56,
      "end_seconds": 28.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.56,
      "end_seconds": 44.77,
      "duration_seconds": 13.21,
      "text": "I've had it for about a week. And itching around my bottom, too. With itching around my bottom, honestly, a couple of times a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.0,
      "end_seconds": 52.42,
      "duration_seconds": 6.42,
      "text": "Have you had a lump near your back passage before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.28,
      "end_seconds": 58.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "I had a similar thing last year. It It went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.77,
      "end_seconds": 81.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.77,
      "end_seconds": 87.88,
      "duration_seconds": 5.11,
      "text": "I'm allergic to grass pollen, I get itchy eyes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.72,
      "end_seconds": 94.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.82,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.57,
      "end_seconds": 113.53,
      "duration_seconds": 17.96,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. I have about eight cigarettes in a day. I hardly move around during the day. I grab fast food at lunch most days. My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.33,
      "end_seconds": 118.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.51,
      "end_seconds": 127.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "I have low haemoglobin, for five years yes, heart disease"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.19,
      "end_seconds": 137.38,
      "duration_seconds": 8.19,
      "text": "okay, I can see low haemoglobin in your file as well. Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.8,
      "end_seconds": 153.1,
      "duration_seconds": 11.3,
      "text": "Just two stents put in my heart, three years ago. I've been reading about it online and it worried me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.21,
      "end_seconds": 168.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.14,
      "end_seconds": 174.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "Iron tablets, once a day for my blood count"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.02,
      "end_seconds": 178.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "when did you start it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.45,
      "end_seconds": 187.66,
      "duration_seconds": 8.21,
      "text": "About three months now. Aspirin, 75 milligrams, once a day. It's a soothing cream, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.41,
      "end_seconds": 194.37,
      "duration_seconds": 5.96,
      "text": "A few quick ones: change in bowel habit, black stools, dizziness or severe pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.5,
      "end_seconds": 198.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "mm, no, I'd have said so"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.54,
      "end_seconds": 200.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "What about fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.61,
      "end_seconds": 204.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "no fever, thankfully"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.16,
      "end_seconds": 207.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.05,
      "end_seconds": 214.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "No, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.82,
      "end_seconds": 227.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.14,
      "end_seconds": 239.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "bear with me while this finishes.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.86,
      "end_seconds": 268.94,
      "duration_seconds": 8.08,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 116 over 75, temperature 36.7, pulse is 80 beats a minute. And respiratory rate 17."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 269.81,
      "end_seconds": 272.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.9,
      "end_seconds": 277.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "I'll explain what these mean in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.61,
      "end_seconds": 281.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.13,
      "end_seconds": 283.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.44,
      "end_seconds": 309.12,
      "duration_seconds": 8.68,
      "text": "There is a small soft lump at the edge of the anus and no tear that I can see."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.18,
      "end_seconds": 322.2,
      "duration_seconds": 9.02,
      "text": "You can relax now. So where does that leave us? I think we're dealing with haemorrhoids at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.59,
      "end_seconds": 325.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.62,
      "end_seconds": 346.9,
      "duration_seconds": 19.28,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like haemorrhoids, but I'd like to confirm. Stop me if I've got anything wrong. You've had a lump near your back passage for about a week, and no fever or dizziness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 347.88,
      "end_seconds": 348.58,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 350.6,
      "end_seconds": 362.6,
      "duration_seconds": 12.0,
      "text": "I think a blood count makes sense here, for rectal bleeding i think a camera test of the bowel makes sense here, for rectal bleeding"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 363.88,
      "end_seconds": 366.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "How long will it take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 366.92,
      "end_seconds": 382.0,
      "duration_seconds": 15.08,
      "text": "Fibre, plenty of water, and don't sit on the toilet for long. The thing that would worry me is if the bleeding gets heavier or you feel faint. If that happens, go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 382.82,
      "end_seconds": 385.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "yes, I'll bear that in mind"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 386.55,
      "end_seconds": 392.27,
      "duration_seconds": 5.72,
      "text": "Book a review in four weeks. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 394.06,
      "end_seconds": 397.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "great, thank you for your help"
    }
  ]
